{"id": 32, "name": "Johnson", "splash": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mobile-legends/images/4/4a/Hero321-portrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20241021141359", "cls": ["Tank", "Support"], "specialty": ["Support", "Crowd Control"], "difficulty": "50", "stats": ["80", "30", "90", "50"], "lanes": ["Roam", ""], "story": "A super cyborg who can transform into a car and lead his teammates into battle.", "skills": [{"name": "Electro Airbag", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_df5fccf91538ea84c5ce22d59d217a5a.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 52, "tagname": "Shield", "tagrgb": "89,168,111"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "When Johnson's HP drops below 30%, he gains a 300<span style=\"color:#26e407\"> (+700% Total Physical Defense)</span> shield for 10s. Cooldown: 100s."}, {"name": "Impact Wrench", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_931a5157d2fadc2f1fe0d6d4941c2939.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 8", "desc": "Johnson throws his wrench toward the target location, dealing 120<span style=\"color:#26e407\"> (+220% Total Physical Defense)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to enemies in its path. Enemies around the landing point are stunned for 0.8s."}, {"name": "Electromagnetic Waves", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_d559adcd5b3f996872c0db6b7673c86c.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 22, "tagname": "Slow", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 10", "desc": "Johnson raises his shield, continuously dealing 120<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+60% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to enemies in a fan-shaped area in the target direction, reducing their Movement Speed and Magic Defense by 10% (stacks up to 3 times) for 2s.\nWhile his shield is raised, Johnson can p